{"data":{"body":"[P3] Remove the obsolete cleanup-budget contract. `PluginRunner.closeHandlerScopes()` closes scopes synchronously, and invocation completion waits for that owner even with an exhausted runtime budget, as `HandlerScopeHandoffTest` asserts. No timeout or five-seconds-per-plugin reservation is enforced. Plugin authors could rely on a cleanup bound that does not exist. Document the unbounded wait and remove the timeout/reservation claims.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc8AAAABAYM1dQ","finding_digest":"7ffc68046b20a7e96ab67486c29cf295615ad3b01b3a5f123e1764bea251fc5a","finding_id":"arf_v1_p76gqbdlect6s2vwosdmfhhssv","finding_key":"sdk/plugin/handler-scoped::lifecycle-contract::bounded-cleanup-guarantee","identity_key":"sdk/plugin/handler-scoped::lifecycle-contract::bounded-cleanup-guarantee","line":23,"observation_digest":"6c89770764e0e3d80d500c58e1acace99724c7e3a70453f1cada9bab68953975","observation_id":"aro_v1_nsexob3e4dr5qdkqbrmodlfm5g","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/plugin/HandlerScoped.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_p76gqbdlect6s2vwosdmfhhssv","published_at":"2026-10-20T00:45:11Z","review_id":"arr_v1_hsyapcvv7br6fexogbd43auzai","reviewed_base_sha":"f82bde356b328f80373d5bd7d35fe65e6ba3f80d","reviewed_head_sha":"34146ffb987116d752c14cc06c64b58d9ce1df7b","reviewer":"codex","start_line":19,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":782},"record_id":"art_v1_rglce4pj4ryjit3hugcsvkstq4","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-20T00:45:11Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
